    "sections": {
        "description": "Property Dealer is a modern and multipurpose theme designed for real estate agencies, property developers, brokers, consultants, and individual agents looking to showcase residential and commercial properties with style. Ideal for real estate website templates, property listing layouts, agency portals, property consultancy pages, housing agency sites, and property broker platforms, this theme features a minimal, elegant, and sophisticated design that ensures each listing appears professional and visually appealing. Built with clean, optimized, and SEO-friendly code, it guarantees fast loading times, smooth performance, and a responsive, retina-ready layout across desktops, tablets, and smartphones. Extensive customization options allow users to personalize layouts, colors, typography, banners, and sections to reflect their brand identity. Dedicated sections for featured listings, expert teams, testimonials, and strategically placed call-to-action buttons enhance engagement and conversions. Integration with essential plugins for contact forms, property management, lead generation, and social media sharing ensures seamless communication and marketing. Translation-ready and agency-friendly, Property Dealer provides a flexible, high-performing platform for real estate professionals to create a polished, trustworthy, and globally accessible online presence."
    },
